    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/e7f01a2a41a44079115df4e7b8f07a1a.poster.avif?t=1752173557\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/e7f01a2a41a44079115df4e7b8f07a1a.webm?t=1752173557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/e7f01a2a41a44079115df4e7b8f07a1a.mp4?t=1752173557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Speak. Interrogate. Decide. But never forget to watch your back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entry Denied</strong> is a <strong>first-person, single-player horror thriller</strong> inspired by <i>Papers, Please</i> and <i>That's Not My Neighbor</i>, featuring a unique <strong>voice command system</strong> that puts you in direct control of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a newly appointed officer at Ironveil Penitentiary, a facility that holds not just the most dangerous criminals \u2014 but also the government\u2019s darkest secrets. Your job: screen visitors, verify documents, and prevent anything... inhuman from getting in \u2014 or out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/f1c1ba196841d5a6ac5e1f9130ce8c63.poster.avif?t=1752173557\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/f1c1ba196841d5a6ac5e1f9130ce8c63.webm?t=1752173557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/f1c1ba196841d5a6ac5e1f9130ce8c63.mp4?t=1752173557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A NEW WAY TO INTERACT: VOICE COMMAND SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget menus and dialogue trees \u2014 in <strong>Entry Denied</strong>, you <strong>speak directly into your microphone</strong> to issue commands, question visitors, and take control of the situation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Say <strong>&quot;Next&quot;</strong> to call the next visitor in line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Say <strong>&quot;Papers&quot;</strong> to request their documents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Ask questions like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What is your name?&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Place of birth?&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Date of birth?&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Who are you here for?&quot;</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Based on their answers and papers, <strong>verify identities and intentions</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This immersive mechanic adds a new layer of realism and tension \u2014 every word matters, and every pause could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/1b3b895bbced998114dc97f63b309049.poster.avif?t=1752173557\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/1b3b895bbced998114dc97f63b309049.webm?t=1752173557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/1b3b895bbced998114dc97f63b309049.mp4?t=1752173557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>THIS PRISON HOLDS MORE THAN JUST CRIMINALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironveil Penitentiary is no ordinary prison. Beneath the surface lies a dark experiment \u2014 one the government doesn\u2019t want you to discover.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subversive groups trying to expose secret operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors aiding escape attempts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapeshifting creatures imitating humans<br>All of them will try to deceive you \u2014 and you must stop them through precise document checks and sharp questioning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But while you\u2019re focused on the papers... <strong>something may be creeping up behind you</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/ddb852c956a2a1b939d0f4d541cc527d.poster.avif?t=1752173557\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/ddb852c956a2a1b939d0f4d541cc527d.webm?t=1752173557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756510/extras/ddb852c956a2a1b939d0f4d541cc527d.mp4?t=1752173557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-controlled gameplay</strong>: Use your microphone to command and interrogate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document inspection mechanics</strong>: Verify IDs, dates, photos, and personal info.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-driven narrative</strong>: Every decision can lead to different consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person perspective</strong>: Feel the tension up close while staying alert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranoia-fueled horror</strong>: Watch out for impostors and hidden threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability with multiple endings</strong>: Your approach defines your story.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not all horror screams. Some of it waits in silence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entry Denied</strong> offers a unique blend of <strong>voice interaction, document verification, and psychological horror</strong>, putting you in a position of authority \u2014 and vulnerability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to begin?<br><strong>Say it with me... &quot;Next.&quot;</strong></p>",
